# Cumulative CVRP: instances of the set A of the CVRP demo, with the number of routes of the CVRP batch.
# The model uses a custom resource: the BaPCod/RCSP library must be built with src/meta_solver/rcsp_custom_res_impl.*
# copied to Tools/rcsp (src and include_dev).
# Tip: after a batch execution, call 'grep statistics: out/A.out -h | cut -c13-' to get the results as rows for a LaTeX table.
# julia src/run.jl -b A.batch &> out/A.out
# Upper bounds are optimal costs + 1 (optima found by this demo, November 2026, in at most 2 minutes each).
# Instances not solved in 2 minutes are commented out (best lower bound after 2 minutes in parentheses).
data/A/A-n37-k6.vrp -m 6 -M 6 -u 34007
data/A/A-n37-k5.vrp -m 5 -M 5 -u 20006
